{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：15:23 2026-09-30 HKT</p>\n\n<p>雖然中秋節已經過去，但仍然有不少人繼續都到維園參觀中秋綵燈會，當中包括「世界綵燈大街」甚受市民歡迎，需要排隊等候多時才可進入展區。康文署及旅發局今日宣布，由於遊覽者眾多，反應熱烈，丙午年中秋綵燈會和國際中秋綵燈匯將再延長綵燈展期至10月7日，讓更多市民和遊客欣賞璀璨綵燈。</p>\n<p>活動自9月17日開展至9月29日的13天內，共錄得約58萬人次到訪，平均每日約4萬5000人次，最高峰單日到訪人次超過20萬。不過，旅發局提醒，為確保活動安全及現場秩序，將視乎人流情況按需要實施人流管理措施。旅發局感謝公眾的支持與配合，並呼籲參觀人士遵從現場工作人員的指示。</p>\n<p></p>\n<img alt=\"維園中秋彩燈會。吳艷玲攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5f04469d63b524047d505a13893d72e8/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260925_192902903_01_-_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4dea703431adb3144ba94bc370d74f60/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260925_192902903_02_-_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e4ad5de6afdf9b7b2b074783b9760afa/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260925_194452207_01_1_-_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/716b47dca15a8f99c784ba4e920b10b9/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260925_194452207_02_-_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/38a2fb5dae107d0d1e88955e08dcdc7a/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260925_194452207_03_-_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5348c85adf688c34978d11c92e9fc169/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260925_194452207_04_-_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c5154de46f70e6dced9eaa7aa343283d/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260925_194452207_05_-_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9a924363fb3f7c4edd6537702909c4f4/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260925_194452207_06_-_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dc7258e009ead7d4a3cb3a50b0b4d395/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260925_194452207_07_-_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2763cd74128c0ea03ff87c0f405873dc/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260925_194452207_08_-_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5487297bda48dfe59d4041979fb25fbb/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260925_194452207_09_-_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c8c4fc4a5dcf92905a0442bc1dd779a2/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260925_194452207_10_-_.jpg\"/>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-30T07:39:52.885792+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":300,"images":12,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}